      "match_notes": "<p><strong>Gidea&nbsp;Park&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Romford:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rule&nbsp;5c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Each&nbsp;member&nbsp;club&nbsp;shall&nbsp;provide&nbsp;a&nbsp;competent&nbsp;scorer.&nbsp;Any&nbsp;club&nbsp;failing&nbsp;to&nbsp;provide&nbsp;a&nbsp;competent&nbsp;scorer&nbsp;for&nbsp;any&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;match&nbsp;in&nbsp;Premier,&nbsp;1st,&nbsp;2nd&nbsp;or&nbsp;3rd&nbsp;Divisions&nbsp;will&nbsp;incur&nbsp;a&nbsp;one&nbsp;point&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;on&nbsp;each&nbsp;occasion.&nbsp;The&nbsp;umpires&nbsp;must&nbsp;advise&nbsp;both&nbsp;teams&nbsp;and&nbsp;indicate&nbsp;to&nbsp;them&nbsp;that&nbsp;a&nbsp;one&nbsp;point&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;will&nbsp;apply.&nbsp;The&nbsp;Umpires&nbsp;must&nbsp;also&nbsp;report&nbsp;the&nbsp;occurrence&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;Umpire&nbsp;Report&nbsp;Form.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>No&nbsp;scorer.&nbsp;1&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;point.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rule&nbsp;18e.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;away&nbsp;team&nbsp;not&nbsp;confirming&nbsp;the&nbsp;match&nbsp;result&nbsp;on&nbsp;play-cricket.com&nbsp;by&nbsp;8pm&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;Monday&nbsp;following&nbsp;the&nbsp;match&nbsp;will&nbsp;have&nbsp;one&nbsp;point&nbsp;deducted.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Gidea&nbsp;Park&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Romford&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI&nbsp;Innings</strong><br />\r\n9.1&nbsp;Gidea&nbsp;Park&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Romford&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;9.1&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;37&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;3&nbsp;extras<br />\r\n17.3&nbsp;2nd&nbsp;Wicket:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;63&nbsp;balls,&nbsp;41&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;Jamal&nbsp;Francis&nbsp;26&nbsp;(35),&nbsp;Shavawn&nbsp;Cunningham&nbsp;20&nbsp;(28),&nbsp;4&nbsp;extras<br />\r\n17.5&nbsp;Jamal&nbsp;Francis:&nbsp;50&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;63&nbsp;balls,&nbsp;70&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;(8x4)<br />\r\n20.3&nbsp;Gidea&nbsp;Park&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Romford&nbsp;CC&nbsp;1st&nbsp;XI:&nbsp;100&nbsp;runs&nbsp;in&nbsp;20.3&nbsp;overs,&nbsp;80&nbsp;minutes,&n